title: 'The future of creative work: BYO ladder'
category: 'Essay: the talent crisis'
description: >
  As AI reshapes junior work and employers buy expertise by the fraction, are we
  automating the rungs of the career ladder while telling people to learn how to
  climb?
publishDate: 2026-09-26
